WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:30.000
Global Astro!

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.030
I still can't get over it

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.030
Even now, you miss me, but I know

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.030
So when you say, "I say that's something to find"

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.030
There's no such thing as confusion

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:42.030
That's right, from here on out

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:51.660
I'll send you a lot of things

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:58.790
I'll send you a lot of things

00:00:58.790 --> 00:00:59.800
I'll send you a lot of things

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.910
and float kemi no maki it's all for you

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.650
君とおしゃべり like artis

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:07.400
俺そんな artistic astro boy

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.850
astro girl皆のはまさに expo expo

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.610
そして next door catch the future

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:13.960
するために let's go

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:14.560
now

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:19.500
思い出は刻まれから

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:27.840
この手に

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.860
So that's how far the Mars Terraforming has come.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.910
The population has increased, but there are more crimes now.

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:12.940
The robots traded here are all illegal, such as stolen goods.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:17.490
It's a robot dark market, isn't it, Yamahou Anka?

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.090
That's right.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:22.450
It's about time for that man to show up.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:26.240
He's been through our mess many times.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:29.190
But today I will definitely arrest him.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.010
This is for you, sir. I've been waiting for you.

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:55.300
Heh, it doesn't look like it, but the most important product is just junk.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.720
There's no doubt. It's a ham egg!

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.250
Let's go in!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.000
Go!

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:10.680
This is bad!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:11.850
What's that?

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:17.900
What is it?

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:22.660
I will not forgive you for torturing an innocent robot!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.600
"Ugh..."

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:40.420
"Eat this too!"

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.390
"Damn you!"

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:45.220
"You scum!"

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.220
"If you're prepared, there's no regret."

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.210
"That's how you survive in space!"

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:51.740
"Huh?"

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.740
"You cruel human!"

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.930
"Ugh..."

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:57.930
"Hehehe..."

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.260
What a strange bastard.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:13.170
What is this memory?

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:16.140
What? Aokichi is on Mars?

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:18.640
Please look at this.

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:22.510
Aokichi has infiltrated and Ham Egg has escaped.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:27.450
Doctor, what is Ham Egg that Tawashi Keibu had marked?

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:30.000
It's a purifying drug that kills the dark robots.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.830
is a sneaky man.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.870
A dark robot crash?

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.940
It's an unnecessary game of rules

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.190
played by a group of heartless people.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:43.570
The robots that are sold on the back route

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:44.820
will be modified,

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:47.160
fought until they become incapable of fighting,

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.340
and destroyed.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:55.050
The man who will take over the worst thing is

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:56.500
the ham egg.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:57.560
That's terrible!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.000
I will never forgive such a thing!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.900
Aokishi felt the same way.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:06.250
That's why he attacked Yami-Ichi and saved the robots.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:10.410
But his way of doing it was too violent.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:24.000
Please answer me, Shadow.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.170
You're the one who created me.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.450
That's right.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:36.530
As I thought, Aokishi is your creation.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:41.430
Then, whose absurd memories have you suddenly recalled?

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:49.800
That's you before you were reborn as Aokishi.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.950
Before I was reborn?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:56.380
I chose you as the base to make the strongest robot.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:59.860
Because you had a strong heart.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:04.310
A strong heart born from the anger of humans.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.460
The anger of humans...

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.830
Hm?

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:28.710
I remembered.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:35.200
But why? Did you erase my memories of the past?

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:40.110
If you are trapped in revenge against an individual, the evolution of your heart will be stopped.

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:44.610
That's why I sealed your memories and left only the feelings of anger.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:49.460
And you, as I expected, acquired an even stronger heart.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:55.100
Shadow, what is the purpose of making me? What should I do?

00:06:55.100 --> 00:07:00.000
Act according to your heart's command. The answer will come one day.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.660
The purpose of Aokishi's creation is one thing.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:09.270
He wants to absorb the Atoms and evolve them to a higher level.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:11.730
Ham Egg!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:15.950
The recent matches are boring, so the customers are complaining about it!

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.690
B-But this is all because of the annoying Aokishi...

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.050
Shut up!

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:23.350
You're a piece of shit!

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:25.270
W-Wait a minute!

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:27.780
I'll set up a special match right away.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.000
A special match?

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:34.040
Of course, the audience is very satisfied.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:38.050
After all, it's a match to make that Aokishi into Kechon Kechon.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:41.060
Alright, then I'll give you the last chance.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:45.290
But if you fail, this time it's your turn.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.920
You're the last one who hates robots.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.460
But I'm in trouble.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:54.300
I made you come out of your mouth and deceive you, but you can't actually do a special match.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.300
Boss, it's a big problem.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:58.110
Paris suddenly started to rampage.

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:00.000
What?

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:15.100
The combat capability of this robot has been dramatically increased.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.210
With this modification of mine,

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:20.980
Who are you?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.110
Would you like to trade with me?

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:39.750
If I knew this place had such a bad atmosphere, I wouldn't have brought Atom with me.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.210
I'm fine with that!

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:44.280
More importantly, we have to gather information about the ham egg.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:46.160
But, Atom...

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:47.770
I'll go ask at this shop!

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.680
W-W-Wait, Atom!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.000
We need to be a little more careful...

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.000
I know.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:08.050
The place and time where he'll buy the robot next.

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:10.610
Where is that?

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.610
That bastard...

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.610
He switched from me to a businessman.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.660
The location is at the foot of Olympus Mountain.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.490
The time is today's noon.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:22.430
I let the robot who taught me that escape on purpose.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.630
I'm sure he'll be able to tell Aokishi by now.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.630
What did you say?

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.710
Doctor, the ham egg is in danger!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.000
Hmph.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:10:00.000
I understand that you want to save the robot, but you're hurting humans. That's something you can't do.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:06.020
Atom, you don't know too much about the nature of humans.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.000
The nature of humans?

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:16.770
While you're waiting for them, I'll tell you about the awful past I once experienced.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:46.840
Hey, Bluebone. Fix it so you can make it to tomorrow's match.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:52.690
With this damage, it's only 70% that can be fixed in a day.

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:54.690
Yeah, that's enough.

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:59.830
But then, we can't fight until the end of the match.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:03.140
If it breaks, I'll fix it again!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.160
That's your job as a repair robot.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:15.720
Bluebone.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:19.120
It's finally my turn to be repaired.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.650
Please take care of me from now on.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:24.910
I see.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:29.210
Because I was able to repair the robots that I broke a lot,

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:30.000
I'm sorry.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.020
So that's how it is.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.910
I'm just sad.

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.820
Sad?

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.370
What a funny word.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:43.360
At that time, I realized that I was questioning a human being.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:51.140
Hehehehehehehehe.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:53.240
I'll fix it by tomorrow.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:55.280
I don't care if it's 50%.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:56.720
All right?

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:58.870
Mothra!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:05.890
The doubt grew bigger within me, and I grew into a fierce rage.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:19.750
Bluebon, it's time for me to be repaired by you, too.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:23.740
I see.

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:28.750
You've been repairing the robots I've destroyed, so you're saying you don't like them.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:29.600
Cusco...

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:35.400
Why do we robots have to obey humans?

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:39.960
Why? Why do you say that?

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.690
I've never seen a robot like you.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:47.230
I'll repair you every day.

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:51.820
But no matter how much I repair you, you'll have to fight until you're broken again.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:54.150
What's the point of such a job?

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:58.420
One day you'll be unable to repair and you'll be abandoned.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.890
We're robots.

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:04.250
We can only fight according to the orders of humans.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:09.860
But if robots have lives, it's my job to save them.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:18.990
As Paris said, you're a very strange robot, and a good one.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:25.860
A few days later, we set off for Mars.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.520
This is the best time to work on Mars!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.880
I'm going to have you repair all the broken robots as soon as possible.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:41.580
I can't.

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:43.090
What did you say?

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:46.070
Are you talking to me?

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.760
Repair as soon as you can if you can't make it in time.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:53.210
Even if it's 10% or 5%, you have to be able to move, you have to be able to move!

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:56.400
Understood.

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.000
I'm getting started.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:20.040
Before arriving on Mars, I prepared an emergency shuttle to let the robots escape.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:25.380
I'm surprised that you're really trying to save us.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:30.000
It's true that robots are made by humans, but we have to be careful.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:41.790
Fear, sadness, and a heart that can be angry.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:54.520
How dare you betray a human being.

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:57.020
You're an insolent piece of iron.

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:59.380
I'll do anything in your place.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:05.600
It's the most important thing to think and act with your own head.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:08.990
What a pity!

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:18.690
Am I going to die in this darkness?

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:25.090
If I... If I have the power...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.080
I will grant you the power you desire.

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:57.600
Why, do you want to kill me?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.670
A strong heart that has evolved.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:04.260
It's because you had what I was looking for.

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:09.170
I was saved by Shadow and became a Blue Knight.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:13.970
I came here to fight a fragile human.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:22.710
This is...

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.310
No one's here!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:29.030
According to the information, about 30 robots were carried here.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.680
Huh?

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.960
Who are you?

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.120
Me?

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:03.360
It's a special card!

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:08.420
So the three of us are the performers of the show?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.700
It's really Atom and Aokishi.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.150
All right, I'll bet on Atom!

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:14.920
Now, which one will bet?

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.080
Please bet as hard as you can!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.680
I don't intend to go along with Yamirobo Clash!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:23.580
Regardless of whether you want to or not,

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.280
the show starts now!

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:47.580
I can hurt humans, but I can't do anything to robots!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.930
That's exactly what that man said!

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:54.260
Atom, Aokishi is a robot that fights against humans.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:59.120
Fight together, and learn about the future you must pursue.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:10.030
Because they are a battle machine that I control!

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.020
How cruel are you!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:56.500
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.600
Don't tell me...

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:15.750
What the hell are you doing, you iron scum?!

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:21.640
Stop! We are not iron scum!

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:23.610
You are...

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:26.800
We also have a heart!

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:29.830
Think with your own heart!

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:36.420
That's the most important thing!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:42.230
I don't care if my electronic intelligence is broken!

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:43.830
Maximum output!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:47.920
Start!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.640
You're still alive, aren't you?

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:06.450
And for the sake of the freedom of the robot...

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:09.720
Stop it!

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:20.040
Atom, turn your rage against humans into power.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.990
We're retreating for now!

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:29.380
I won't forgive you alone, Hamue-kun!

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:31.760
Fugaaaaa!

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:49.780
It's up to you to protect humans.

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:53.570
But I will protect the freedom and the future of the robots!

00:20:53.570 --> 00:21:00.000
You know, Gusco...

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:03.680
Bluebone, will you prepare me again?

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:06.080
Yes, of course, my friend.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.680
Me too.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:09.000
I will go with you.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.780
The path you believe in.

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:15.590
Will you fight with humans with me?

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:16.900
Yes.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:26.920
Shadow, you created a robot that exceeded my expectations.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:30.000
Aokishi will eventually become the world itself.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.810
and evolve the Atom into the ultimate robot.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:38.370
To the king of robots, which I consider to be my ideal.

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:41.660
Human and robot.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:45.350
Someday, I'm sure we'll understand each other.

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:46.260
Hm?

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:49.590
Yes.

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:52.730
As long as I have the heart to believe that,

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:54.480
someday, I'm sure we'll understand each other.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:27.370
Hi, I'm Story-Terror-Robot Friday.

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:29.800
Do you believe in fairies?

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:32.730
When children laugh, fairies are born.

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:37.360
Next time on Fairy Tale: Catch the Future with your heart!
